{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e897d6006945d2809bed","chatId":"22265e03b66a470f9e481e5e3f043202","sessionId":null,"userId":67969,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":846,"promptTokens":1486,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:27"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006689988226477923,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e897d6006945d2809bec","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369687971,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e897d6006945d2809bec","chatId":"22265e03b66a470f9e481e5e3f043202","sessionId":null,"userId":67969,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小艾整夜都在为艺术展览而作画。她充满了怀疑，质疑这幅画是否足够好供公众欣赏。当她完成并离开时，她的小弟弟走进房间。他站在那里，凝视着画了一会儿，然后转向小艾，眼睛瞪大，脸上露出了灿烂的微笑。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小艾最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 释怀\nB) 害怕\nC) 信任\nD) 反对\nE) 伤心\nF) 伤感\n\n## 问题 2\n小艾为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 虽然她认为她的画不够好，但是她的小弟弟的认可增强了她的信心，让她释怀\nB) 小艾完成了她的画作\nC) 小艾熬夜了\nD) 小艾对她的画作存有疑虑","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006689988226477923,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e897d6006945d2809bed","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369687969,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c352f5cfc3e242139361dd3082a178c9"}